  "notes": "USAGE:\nCan describe both physical agility (nimble movements) and quickness of response or action (prompt replies, swift decisions). Often used as a modifier before nouns: {素早|すばや}い{動|うご}き, {素早|すばや}い{判断|はんだん}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {素早|すばや}い{動|うご}き (quick movement)\n- {素早|すばや}い{対応|たいおう} (prompt response)\n- {素早|すばや}い{判断|はんだん} (quick judgment)\n- {素早|すばや}く{動|うご}く (to move quickly)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {速|はや}い: fast — general speed, broader usage\n- {敏捷|びんしょう}な: agile, nimble — more formal, literary\n- {機敏|きびん}な: alert, quick-witted — emphasizes mental quickness",
